{'symbol': 'ALLE', 'date': '2023-03-07 17:00:00', 'title': 'ALLEGION TO ATTEND 2023 BANK OF AMERICA GLOBAL INDUSTRIALS CONFERENCE', 'text': "DUBLIN--(BUSINESS WIRE)--ALLEGION PLC (NYSE: ALLE) PRESIDENT AND CEO JOHN H. STONE AS WELL AS SENIOR VICE PRESIDENT AND CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER MIKE WAGNES WILL DISCUSS THE COMPANY'S LONG-TERM STRATEGY AT THE 2023 BANK OF AMERICA GLOBAL INDUSTRIALS CONFERENCE ON TUESDAY, MARCH 21. THE CONFERENCE WILL BE HELD AT THE LANDMARK HOTEL IN LONDON. A LIVE LISTEN-ONLY WEBCAST WILL BE ACCESSIBLE VIA ALLEGION'S INVESTOR WEBSITE AT INVESTOR.ALLEGION.COM OR DIRECTLY BY CLICKING HERE."}